lnerability/sonatype-2019-0422?component-type=3Dmaven&component-name=3Dorg.=
apache.kafka%2Fkafka-streams&utm_source=3Dossindex-client&utm_medium=3Dinte=
gration&utm_content=3D1.7.0] in your PR would be enough?
 ## Does someone in Confluent know about this stuff that you can talk to?
 ## ????
 # reopen, 'adjust' and merge the original PR... hopefully triggering SonaT=
ype to mark the issue resolved.

