             Summary: Delete kafka.tools.JmxTool redirection object
                 Key: KAFKA-14705
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14705
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Federico Valeri
             Fix For: 4.0.0


The kafka.tools.JmxTool (core module) has been deprecated and migrated to org.apache.kafka.tools.JmxTool (tools module) in 3.5. With that release, kafka.tools.JmxTool prints a warning and then redirects to the new class. This is just a reminder to get rid of that redirection in 4.0.



