The package "org.apache.kafka.common" disallows to import "org.apache.kafka.c=
lients.producer.ProducerRecord". Hence, "org.apache.kafka.common.RecordReader=
" can't reference "org.apache.kafka.clients.producer.ProducerRecord" directly=
. It seems to me the tool-related interface should be able to access all publ=
ic classes from "common", "producer", "consumer", and "admin". Accordingly, I=
'd like to move the package of "RecordReader"  from "org.apache.kafka.common"=
 to ""org.apache.kafka.clients.tool".=20

Please take a look at above change.

thanks,
